07_1351545363214646_5506338495222860567_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Xke4hsTudJwQ7kNvwF7hfu5&_nc_oc=AdpbhDFEljAkPs9MEieUc1YGCIilo6jIuXNE4toExGYHXbD2U1PTv54K78TKgFPTJPk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNK-f2BTK61L2uMijK82XaD-s3lasXka3OLk1rG_Dh2Ng&oe=6ACB9AC2"}, {"file_name": "ss5.png", "id": "1715729295759342", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499305050_1715729299092675_4690986203494255387_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LQIL-5TuLNwQ7kNvwF3AwZU&_nc_oc=AdqQSn1nHG_Ib0cuOgwG_tqnOglXtFxSVONwkn_BJ0ZY9WahIjorNSxtNciB1rE22sQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMqYzR7-W957CTS-aABn7vvZttuTWqMarIb7x5xksmzAA&oe=6ACB903F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Portrait.png", "id": "806605711863955", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823486_806605715197288_1898259061609879939_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GyY-RcApOV8Q7kNvwHIYo-c&_nc_oc=Ado-MEFaMwL2FyLESoAoNE5EOwzlQol5mpsdXTaJhWHR4wbhZapuHuxZotF5_h9b1GA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQP0Vm49WMjw2F-aANa3nGZ_hURr9nj5l7l1LlEUl_iyjQ&oe=6ACB9F30"}, "display_name": "Afterlife: Dead Zone", "keywords": ["zombies", "shooter", "disparos", "zombis", "horror"], "long_description": "In Afterlife: Dead Zone, you play as a soldier trapped in the Dead Zones, isolated areas where help seems impossible. Humanity teeters on the brink of extinction: ancient alien civilizations have returned to assess our development and, deeming us a threat, unleash weapons of mass destruction that turn people into bloodthirsty monsters.\n\nExplore dark, devastated post-apocalyptic environments where hordes of zombies and mutated creatures can appear around every corner. Your mission is simple but deadly: shoot and avoid dying. While your weapons have infinite ammo, the variety and ferocity of enemies will demand strategy and quic